  "contract": {
    "launch_requirements": [
      "Exact source request hashes remain immutable; strict JSON parser rejects duplicate keys and unknown command/config options.",
      "Runtime request is a reversible, explicit journal of only approved binary/source/runtime location rebinding. Original scientific fields, including preparation_source_hash, estimation input hashes, case, weights, mask and hyperparameters, reconstruct exactly.",
      "Direct immutable candidate04 numerics.backend.fit_job calls its own NativeModel.initial_state and minimize. No monkeypatch, state override, fixed-point shortcut, point029 state, nuisance donor or warm-start environment.",
      "Original prepared native orbit is the existing nominal-force closure of GNSS-only bootstrap. Preserve it; do not silently replace it with raw TRF bootstrap or another fitted orbit. Initial dynamic force coordinates are zero.",
      "Clear inherited environment; pin one-thread runtime flags including ORBIT_POC_NUISANCE_CONDITIONAL_QR=1 and audited run14 fixed-dynamics/cost-only/cache flags. Every physical evaluation cold-refits nuisance parameters in a fresh native process.",
      "Exact current-boot/current-host CPU and resource admission, serial two-job order, current native/Python/library/source identities, 7200s per-fit, 8GiB process tree and owned pidfd/subreaper cleanup.",
      "Actual namespace probe proves all input aliases and read-only originals, denied truth/GNV/evaluation/saved-state/donor paths, output separation and dependency closure. Broad read-only host visibility is not truth isolation.",
      "Exercise real candidate04 config construction for both methods without native execution. Historical alias/canonical replacement must route every output including final covariance to the fresh job backing; retain explicit namespace-to-host artifact identity mapping.",
      "Reject an existing/nonempty output, changed request/source/input/runtime/control identity, missing file, stale admission/probe, or uncertain cleanup. No reuse of prior fit artifacts or passes."
    ],
    "terminal_success_requirements": [
      "Worker and owned supervisor completed successfully; all output/input/source identities unchanged; empty-tree cleanup kernel_ECHILD and no unresolved descendants.",
      "Actual result numerical_status=status=complete, converged=true and covariance_valid=true; iterations/native_runtime agree. Exit zero, covariance files, partial stage receipts or small damped steps alone are insufficient.",
      "Trace genuine full fitting: original initial conversion, point001-initial closure/profile, repeat and closure-refinement, actual physical trial evaluation histories as required, outer confirmation and a separate final-covariance point. Do not impose positive iteration count if the original cold start truly satisfies strict fresh criteria.",
      "Final confirmation and final-covariance nuisance profiles are strict: not floor-limited, threshold1e-8m, two consecutive undamped updates below threshold, fresh full-system update below threshold. Audited floor-limited intermediate progress remains permitted by the unchanged optimizer.",
      "Fresh complete original-coordinate factor: lambda=0, full statistical rank including native SVD and Python rank thresholds, original dynamic/global nuisance coordinates. Conditional-only factors cannot authorize physical covariance.",
      "Fresh undamped final dynamic correction satisfies original limits: position<3e-5m, density<1e-4, pulse<1e-8m/s, normalized gradient<1e-8. Require support and preprocessing/weights/ambiguity identity unchanged.",
      "Accepted steps preserve positive actual reduction, minimum gain ratio and original inexact-profile forcing policy; rejected points are not installed. Preserve every rejected trial and failed/profile-limited point.",
      "Final covariance artifacts bind to the final accepted physical state, fresh final factor, exact native binary and source. Verify finite/positive-definite Cartesian blocks and nuisance-marginalized full parameter scope. Native files may be written before later stale-covariance or wall-limit rejection, so result status takes precedence.",
      "Failure, timeout, rank issue or incomplete history stays a failed/limited attempt. Do not shorten arcs, change budgets, rerun silently or replace frozen benchmark results. Successful one-hour fits establish only bounded engineering completion."
    ],
    "required_negative_tests": [
      "altered original request, missing input, changed binary/source/runtime identity, forbidden scientific edit or unlisted journal key",
      "point029/other saved physical initialization and nuisance donor/warm environment rejected",
      "truth/reference/evaluation path visibility, unexpected input alias, wrong overlay backing or writable original denied",
      "existing output, wrong source/output root, escaped final covariance destination or unresolvable namespace-only artifact rejected",
      "stale boot/current-host admission, competing native workload, resource overrun, uncertain process identity and missing cleanup fail closed",
      "final floor-limited profile, stale/damped/conditional factor, missing fresh confirmation, timeout with existing covariance and nonfinite/invalid covariance rejected",
      "legitimate intermediate audited numerical-floor progress remains permitted without becoming convergence"
    ],
